<p><a href="https://www.idcare.org/smallbusiness" target="_blank" data-clicktrack="resources-scamwatch" class="text--html-blue-link link-no-underline" rel="nofollow">Small Business Cyber Resilience Service</a>&nbsp;<img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/Icons/ico-newwindow.svg" style="display: inline;"></p>
<p><a href="https://www.actnowstaysecure.gov.au/" target="_blank" data-clicktrack="act-now-business" class="text--html-blue-link link-no-underline" rel="nofollow">Act Now. Stay Secure.</a>&nbsp;<img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/Icons/ico-newwindow.svg" style="display: inline;"></p>
